{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/89c04639e14165b29e8f31c52c3e6530.avif?t=1771807238\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to experience a thrilling top-down arcade racing game that's inspired by the classic 90s racing games you know and love.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Power Racing League is the prestigious racing competition where ruthless competitors from around the world come together to tear up the track and power their way to victory</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 vehicles (3 starter + 6 unlockable)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade + 1 season of career mode + the driving school (more coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 mode types (Timebomb, Speed Race, Power Race) + a special career event &quot;Zombo Blast&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/bbeb1cd7d377292dc8692a076894034e.avif?t=1771807238\" width=905 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start at the driving school or jump straight into specially curated events which give you the chance to drive new vehicles. Get podiums to unlock new content for Arcade mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/70aab4b9e50f37094e0bcdd17b6012eb.poster.avif?t=1771807238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/70aab4b9e50f37094e0bcdd17b6012eb.webm?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/70aab4b9e50f37094e0bcdd17b6012eb.mp4?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40b5b46f78fff78d6c5f2ecbf07ba81f.avif?t=1771807238\" width=585 height=86 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock lots of different vehicles from compact cars to drift monsters and even ice cream vans. Vehicles can be unlocked in Career and Arcade mode, check the unlock screen to see how to unlock new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.poster.avif?t=1771807238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.webm?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.mp4?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/6e80d155fc702c729e3b5c1d43323dfa.avif?t=1771807238\" width=754 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out the competition using mines or missiles or simply land on top of them to take them out on fully destructible tracks. Expect to smash through barriers, boats, helicopters, signs and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40f7d5e464ae89f76d1fe315c7bcf45d.poster.avif?t=1771807238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40f7d5e464ae89f76d1fe315c7bcf45d.webm?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40f7d5e464ae89f76d1fe315c7bcf45d.mp4?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/2ee6101a56fc28b2987f00f284699431.avif?t=1771807238\" width=678 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here in the Super Power Racing League we don't settle for just racing, we mix it up! Expect Power Races with weapons, speed boosts and oil slicks, Time bomb races were we strap a bomb on your roof and see how many checkpoints you can hit before you go boom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also sometimes zombies happen so it's time to take them out too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/ba57532d2b1d166e8c57f4438ddc9bc2.poster.avif?t=1771807238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/ba57532d2b1d166e8c57f4438ddc9bc2.webm?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/ba57532d2b1d166e8c57f4438ddc9bc2.mp4?t=1771807238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/c3b5a29f4b3046f42ee3a49e25a7f31b.avif?t=1771807238\" width=811 height=85 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"B